# Copy to /etc/terva-lampi/serve.env (mode 0600).
# The systemd system unit reads this file when it exists. Values here
# replace the unit's defaults. systemd substitutes them into --addr,
# --data, and --token-file. terva-lampi serve does not read these names.
#
# Keep the listen address on loopback. Put TLS in front. See
# docs/vps-bringup.md. Do not put a production hostname in this file.
# The token line is a path, not the token.

# LAMPI_SERVE_ADDR=127.0.0.1:8787
# LAMPI_SERVE_DATA=/var/lib/terva-lampi
# LAMPI_SERVE_TOKEN_FILE=/var/lib/terva-lampi/tokens

# Optional OIDC dashboard; empty/unset leaves it disabled.
# LAMPI_SERVE_WEB_CONFIG=/etc/terva-lampi/web.json
